onAuthStateChanged(auth,user=>{currentUser=user||null;renderAccount(currentUser);const container=$('storyContainer');if(container){container.dataset.owner=isOwner(currentUser)?'true':'false';container.querySelectorAll('.delete-story-btn').forEach(b=>b.remove())}});
const q=query(collection(db,'stories'),orderBy('createdAt','desc'));
onSnapshot(q,snapshot=>{
 const container=$('storyContainer');if(!container)return;
 if(snapshot.empty){container.innerHTML='<article class="card" style="text-align:center;align-items:center;padding:45px 22px"><h2 style="color:var(--gold);font-size:24px">Coming Soon</h2><p>There are no published story episodes yet. Please check back later for live updates.</p></article>';return}
 container.replaceChildren();snapshot.docs.forEach(docSnap=>{const data=docSnap.data(),article=document.createElement('article');article.className='card story-card';article.style.marginBottom='15px';const title=document.createElement('h2');title.style.color='var(--gold)';title.textContent=data.title||'Untitled Story';const desc=document.createElement('p');desc.textContent=data.description||'';const actions=document.createElement('div');actions.className='story-actions';const read=document.createElement('button');read.className='btn btn-gold';read.type='button';read.textContent='Read Story ↗';read.addEventListener('click',e=>{e.stopPropagation();openStoryDrawer(data.title||'Untitled Story',data.description||'')});actions.append(read);if(isOwner(currentUser)){const del=document.createElement('button');del.className='btn btn-outline delete-story-btn';del.type='button';del.textContent='Delete';del.addEventListener('click',async e=>{e.stopPropagation();if(confirm('Delete this story episode?'))try{await deleteDoc(doc(db,'stories',docSnap.id))}catch(err){alert('Delete failed. Check Firestore rules.')}});actions.append(del)}article.append(title,desc,actions);article.addEventListener('click',()=>openStoryDrawer(data.title||'Untitled Story',data.description||''));container.append(article)})
},err=>{console.error(err);$('storyContainer').innerHTML='<article class="card"><h2>Stories unavailable</h2><p>Please try again later.</p></article>'});
